        "Title": "When Flowers Die",
        "Location": "LOCATION_ANCESTRAL_SMOOTHSNAKE",
        "PublicId": "133151786857",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/Ancestral/scene_smoothsnake.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 0dd81be5-208f-48d9-81fa-8439b9dfa095).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47,\r\rHow do you feel about visiting the Dartmoor Flower Show? This contract is from a rival host whom feels they got cheated out of hosting this specific event, thanks to an unforeseen accident leaving their venue out of commission. The victim believes the recent inspections to confirm the safety of their property was handled by &quot;Ten-Minute Terry&quot;. The employee that hired Terry? Kirby Ward. Your mission is to kill Kirby, and the contestents of the show.\r\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare, 47.",
